WEBVTT

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:05.500
It's Island Nine from here.

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:08.130
It's humongous!

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:09.550
Where's the red root?

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:11.010
Let me see.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:16.640
I feel something warm from over there.
The root is still continuing along.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:20.390
I think it passes
right under this white fog.

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:24.310
Perfect. Let's cross that mountain.

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:36.110
Inside the dark my heartbeat echoes

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:43.000
Long night will continue on

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:46.580
Time to face the hell that surrounds you
Before you crash and burn

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:49.960
Within the fire
Your soul will rise now

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:09.400
Breathe in, breathe out
Your blank gaze on the brink of life

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:16.200
Step hard on the accelerator now
Escape the tunnel and overtake that pain

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:23.200
A shadow disappears into smoke

00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:31.040
Lost light will continue on tomorrow

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:38.180
Someday our world will change
Inside a fantasy Remember, remember

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:45.270
I will mercilessly break your dream
and steal it away, with these hands

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:51.650
Until this body breaks
Beyond the limit We'll never surrender

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:55.070
Endless agony

00:01:55.530 --> 00:01:59.320
Finding my life in the KEMURIKUSA

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:01.370
Now...

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:04.080
How do we get across?

00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:08.710
I hope it won't collapse...

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:18.010
It says it'll be fine.

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:19.260
Hey!

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:23.100
Don't trust it too much.
You never know what might happen.

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:26.850
It's okay. We'll be fine
if we follow it for now.

00:02:27.020 --> 00:02:28.560
You can read what it says?

00:02:28.730 --> 00:02:30.980
It just had that expression.

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:34.780
That's right.

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:41.660
"Rin is hot-tempered."

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:46.200
No, I just read what it says!
It's Shiro, not me!

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:48.370
Rina, go ahead and eat it.

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:50.170
Really?

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:03.510
Whoa! That scared me.

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:06.220
What is that?

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:08.230
I've never seen that color.

00:03:08.640 --> 00:03:09.890
And below...

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:13.440
The red fog again.

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:15.570
There are Red Bugs too.

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:18.490
The color is dark.
Must be because of the root.

00:03:18.990 --> 00:03:20.740
Let's be cautious.

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:36.000
Maybe the other islands were
also like this down below.

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:37.710
Hence, the earthquakes.

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:47.140
Never seen anything so huge.

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:48.810
What a grand mountain.

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:51.640
Not even Rinacchi could eat it up.

00:03:57.190 --> 00:03:58.440
Gobble, gobble.

00:03:58.610 --> 00:04:00.150
You just ate something.

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:01.780
I did not...

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:07.660
This is tough.

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:10.290
Wakaba-kun, why don't you hop on?

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:13.830
I'm fine, I can walk.

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:22.420
We've come pretty far.

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:30.810
-Look, isn't that Island Six?
-Where?

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:32.890
On the left.

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:36.610
Oh, I can see Island Seven too!

00:04:37.060 --> 00:04:41.650
So Island Seven's tree
had been stopping the red root.

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:50.450
There's no red fog, but I can't see far.
Be careful.

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:52.000
Okay.

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:54.920
I don't hear any bugs.

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:57.830
Maybe it's too high up for them.

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:05.800
The fog is beginning to lift.

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:07.510
Rina wants to eat more.

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:11.970
It's...

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:16.100
A wall.

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:17.730
Here too?

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:28.490
Wow, another huge wall.

00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:30.530
But the color...

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:37.420
Can you open this too, Wakaba?

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:40.250
Wakaba-kun, could you open it for us?

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:44.880
Sure, there are no bugs here,
so I can take my time.

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:57.940
Hey!

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:02.820
You're not hurting him!

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:13.580
It's moving inside the wall.

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:15.910
This sound... It's Nushi!

00:06:21.630 --> 00:06:23.920
Everyone, get back!

00:06:24.090 --> 00:06:26.380
It's calling the red root!

00:06:34.220 --> 00:06:35.520
It's using the wall.

00:06:35.680 --> 00:06:38.100
-The red fog is thick.
-We're going to melt!

00:06:38.270 --> 00:06:40.650
We have to retreat!

00:06:46.190 --> 00:06:47.650
It's not chasing us.

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:50.240
Maybe it can't leave the wall.

00:06:51.780 --> 00:06:55.660
What if I open the wall
and you attack it when it comes out?

00:06:55.830 --> 00:06:58.200
That'd put you in danger.

00:06:58.370 --> 00:07:01.540
If we agitate it too much,
it'll call the red root.

00:07:01.710 --> 00:07:04.130
We need a way to finish it in one blow.

00:07:09.050 --> 00:07:11.130
The red fog is drifting downwards.

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:13.430
Let's wait for it to clear first.

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:16.560
Yes, let's think of a plan.

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:22.770
What a comfy place.

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:24.900
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:26.860
We can see the wall from here.

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:29.360
Do you all have enough water?

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:32.360
Sis, can't we avoid the wall?

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:35.830
This mountain is surrounded
by the red fog.

00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:38.500
We'll have to go past that wall.

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:41.500
-Can't we destroy it with the wall?
-Yeah.

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:46.090
It took Ryo-chan
a lot of hits to break it.

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:48.130
One blow will be too tough...

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:52.930
I'll use my main body
to attack over and over.

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:56.180
That's too dangerous
with the red root and everything.

00:07:56.350 --> 00:07:59.100
Let's think of something else.

00:07:59.270 --> 00:08:00.520
Yeah...

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:08.570
Right, we've walked a lot.
Let's get some rest.

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:13.070
Yeah, I can see better
when it's light out.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:16.070
I'll be on the lookout.

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:19.490
Midori-chan will tell you
if the red fog or a Red Bug comes.

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:22.500
Okay, let's take turns then.

00:08:29.920 --> 00:08:31.260
She's already asleep.

00:08:31.420 --> 00:08:36.470
She's been alert this whole time.
She's really tired.

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:39.060
Let's let her rest up.

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:40.640
Yeah.

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:43.390
-Aren't you going to sleep yet?
-Yeah.

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:47.400
I will after a little bit.

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:49.690
Okay then, good night.

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:53.650
-You should sleep too.
-Or you won't grow big.

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:06.330
Shiro.

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:10.090
I thought I'd think
while I took a look around.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:14.260
We don't have much water left,
so we need to hurry.

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:19.300
And if we don't think of something,
Rin-san will be in danger tomorrow.

00:09:20.470 --> 00:09:26.440
I'm not much of a fighter,
but maybe I can help think of something.

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:32.400
But I can't see much at night.

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:38.570
The root is still glowing.

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:42.200
The fog is gone, but the root is the same.

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:46.660
I guess I'll have to be careful
even if it's night.

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:51.630
I'll get a closer look.

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:56.380
I'll have my Kemurikusa ready,
just in case.

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:09.060
Hmm... You are...?

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:14.070
You noticed me faster than I noticed you.

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:17.280
Maybe you sense more than just smell.

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:20.820
Oh, you're the one Riku was talking about.

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:25.500
I heard all about you.
Looks like you're still alive.

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:26.910
How's everyone else?

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:29.000
Uh, good?

00:10:29.710 --> 00:10:33.460
You have a bug? You're a strange one.

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:36.590
Are you sisters with Rin-san
and the others?

00:10:37.300 --> 00:10:40.130
I'm Ryo, the eldest.

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:41.720
Nice to meet you.

00:10:45.390 --> 00:10:47.850
You smell kind of funny.

00:10:48.020 --> 00:10:50.940
Do I smell? I'm sorry.

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:53.440
Oh no, you smell nice. It's just...

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:56.780
Hmm, what is this smell?

00:10:57.860 --> 00:11:01.200
You're really not one of us.

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:05.370
You do smell of Kemurikusa, though.
A different color?

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:10.960
So, that's what's troubling you, right?

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:12.630
Yes, that's right.

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:17.590
I know, tough stuff, huh?
A Nushi that uses walls.

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:20.050
The world sure is huge.

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:24.800
Yes, it was hard enough
just fighting a regular Nushi.

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:28.680
You beat a Nushi?
Wow, you're pretty amazing.

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:34.730
Oh no, not me. It was Rin-san.
I just helped, or tried to anyways.

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:37.280
Wanna try and fight me?

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:38.780
No thank you!

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:42.910
Oh darn. You look pretty tough.

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:47.870
You're a strange bug too.
Good bug, good bug.

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:52.250
Bugs that don't smell of red fog
sure are cute.

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:54.500
Want to fight me?

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:58.710
She scares me... She's not normal either.

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:03.720
Um, I heard you were really strong.

00:12:04.430 --> 00:12:07.140
Not as much as Rin-chan, though.

00:12:07.310 --> 00:12:10.180
She just doesn't like to fight.

00:12:10.350 --> 00:12:12.560
You have to like it to be good.

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:14.980
Or fight for something you like.

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:18.570
Ricchan was really strong in that sense.

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:23.320
I heard that you were, um, dead...

00:12:23.740 --> 00:12:28.280
I know, what a surprise, right?

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:31.410
Messed up with the second Nushi.

00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:35.000
I was supposed to have died
under Rin-chan's watch.

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:38.290
But seems like I was saved into this leaf.

00:12:38.460 --> 00:12:41.170
I don't know much about it though.

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:46.140
But I'll use it up if I fight once more.

00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:48.390
Oh yeah, Riku-chan is here too.

00:12:48.550 --> 00:12:50.850
Huh? What do you mean?

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:54.690
So, where are you all headed now?

00:12:54.850 --> 00:12:59.650
We're following the red root
to do something about the trunk.

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:02.490
That's the spirit!

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:06.360
I bet it's a really huge tree.

00:13:06.530 --> 00:13:09.120
And it'll attack from above, right?

00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:12.450
It'll come like this, so you go like this!

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:17.880
And it'll regrow even if you cut it,
so you do this till you reach the trunk.

00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:21.710
You tear it up, and bam!

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:24.220
-Well?
-Uh, yes.

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:28.930
Oh, I wish I could fight it.
Wonder if I can beat it.

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:33.770
But you have to do something
about that first, huh.

00:13:33.930 --> 00:13:38.060
The wall in one blow, huh. One blow...

00:13:38.900 --> 00:13:41.400
I know, let's ask Ryoku-chan.

00:13:41.570 --> 00:13:43.320
She's up.

00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:45.900
Ryoku-chan, Ryoku-chan.

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:48.570
The wall?

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:53.330
It's just a regular wall.

00:13:55.710 --> 00:14:00.130
How to break it?
Well, there is a way, but...

00:14:01.590 --> 00:14:04.510
Who is this? I've never seen him before.

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:08.010
Oh, my name is Wakaba.

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:16.850
It's made a little differently,
but it's just another human form.

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:21.150
Bye. I don't like to waste my leaf.

00:14:22.690 --> 00:14:24.230
That's how she is.

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:27.320
-Inside the leaf...
-Hey!

00:14:27.490 --> 00:14:30.160
Where did you get that?

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:32.870
Ritsu-san gave it to me...

00:14:33.030 --> 00:14:35.500
That's my diary!

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:40.750
Why did she give it to you?
What was my sister thinking?

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:44.800
Oh, but you can't read it,
so I guess it's fine.

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:49.590
Oh, are you the one
who wrote about this world?

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:53.720
Why are you able to read...?

00:14:54.850 --> 00:14:57.600
I have no choice but to kill you...

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:03.230
Wow. So it must be the wall.

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:08.240
Yeah, that's what I think.
Because of what's written after that.

00:15:08.740 --> 00:15:11.950
You're pretty good,
realizing all that by yourself.

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:14.870
Oh no, it's all thanks to Rin-san
and everyone.

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:20.620
But if we could see from a bit higher up,
we could understand more.

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:22.420
Like from a ship.

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:25.090
Yeah. I know, right?

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:30.760
I have this feeling somebody made
this world deliberately.

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:32.340
With some intention.

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:36.350
Was it already like this
when you were all born?

00:15:36.850 --> 00:15:42.980
Yeah. If we could've opened
the Memory Leaf, we could learn more.

00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:45.570
But it's locked, you know?

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:50.700
Why would anybody do that?
What a waste...

00:15:51.240 --> 00:15:53.610
And that Daidai that you have.

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:57.370
The First Person wrote the basics in it.

00:15:57.540 --> 00:16:00.250
But it doesn't say about before that.

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:03.210
Did you see the erased page?

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:08.670
Yes. Here, right?
The one that has been erased.

00:16:09.130 --> 00:16:12.550
Like, why would anybody do that?

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:14.930
I don't care where I come from.

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:19.180
But I could've known more
about this world if I had this.

00:16:19.600 --> 00:16:23.480
That's where the Memory Leaf comes in.
Who has it now?

00:16:23.640 --> 00:16:26.940
Rina-san said Rin-san has it now.

00:16:27.110 --> 00:16:30.740
You can touch Kemurikusa
and use it, right?

00:16:30.900 --> 00:16:32.490
Yes, somewhat.

00:16:32.900 --> 00:16:37.620
Let me know if you unlock the Memory Leaf
and learn something.

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:42.120
If you can open Daidai,
you might be able to open that too.

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:45.790
There seems to be some time left.

00:16:45.960 --> 00:16:49.500
I'd like to know the root of the matter
before I disappear.

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:55.970
This is a gloomy world, but it's fun if
you consider how much there is to learn.

00:16:58.470 --> 00:17:03.230
So hurry up and touch that leaf
while Rin still has it.

00:17:03.390 --> 00:17:06.440
But she's kind of wary about me.

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:08.810
I don't think she'll let me...

00:17:08.980 --> 00:17:11.190
Just use force.

00:17:11.360 --> 00:17:12.690
She'd kill me!

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:15.860
Oh right, she has good eyesight now...

00:17:16.030 --> 00:17:20.330
I shouldn't have given her my eyes.

00:17:20.910 --> 00:17:25.830
By the way, where did you come from?
Aren't you interested in that?

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:28.040
I'm not, actually.

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:31.380
I'm more interested in Kemurikusa
and stuff.

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:34.090
Yeah, I know.

00:17:34.670 --> 00:17:39.350
Anyways, we need to do it
before the red tree sinks the world.

00:17:39.510 --> 00:17:42.310
Yes, we must defeat it.

00:17:42.470 --> 00:17:47.310
Huh? No way! Just give it up.

00:17:47.480 --> 00:17:51.980
More importantly, learn more
about this world before you die.

00:17:52.150 --> 00:17:55.650
But it's for Rin-san
and the others' safety.

00:17:57.150 --> 00:18:02.330
If you can touch Kemurikusa, you might
be able to control the red tree too.

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:07.370
I'm not positive,
but the trunk must be like Midori's.

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:09.580
Maybe you can stop it by touching it.

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:12.880
Really? Thank you so much, Ryoku-san!

00:18:13.050 --> 00:18:16.130
You really do care for your sisters.

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:19.090
Care for my sisters...?

00:18:19.260 --> 00:18:23.810
You really read the entire diary, huh?

00:18:25.470 --> 00:18:30.480
Anyways, you have to do something
about that wall.

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:33.440
I wouldn't mind doing it.

00:18:33.610 --> 00:18:36.190
You just want to fight.

00:18:36.610 --> 00:18:40.070
If it's your last chance,
fight the red tree.

00:18:40.240 --> 00:18:44.080
You have a point. Tough decision.

00:18:44.240 --> 00:18:47.080
You can't come out at once?

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:52.630
Isn't there a way, Ryoku-chan?
Like what you were just saying.

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:58.510
I think you could do it
using Midori's branch.

00:18:58.670 --> 00:19:02.640
Huh? But that's Ricchan's precious tree.

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:05.100
That'd be too harsh on her.

00:19:05.260 --> 00:19:09.980
You're the one that asked me!
I know that too.

00:19:10.140 --> 00:19:13.560
But you're right. That's the only way.

00:19:14.150 --> 00:19:18.190
I think Ritsu-san would want to
decide for herself.

00:19:18.360 --> 00:19:22.370
About Midori-san too,
but more than that...

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:26.490
Anyways, I'll ask her.

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:35.880
Do you realize what Midori means to her?

00:19:39.970 --> 00:19:41.590
I understand.

00:19:42.300 --> 00:19:44.600
I never noticed that.

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:48.140
Midori-chan's main body
is stronger than ever.

00:19:48.310 --> 00:19:49.100
But...!

00:19:49.480 --> 00:19:54.610
We have to do something about the wall
and the tree, or Midori-chan will wither.

00:19:55.610 --> 00:19:59.190
But when will it come out?
What if we miss?

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:01.530
I'll lure it out.

00:20:02.150 --> 00:20:06.200
It'll come when I try to open the wall,
so do it then.

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:07.580
But...

00:20:07.990 --> 00:20:11.960
I can't let you and Midori-san
do everything alone.

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:15.670
Let's all do this together, until we win!

00:20:29.430 --> 00:20:31.730
Sis, you don't have to do this.

00:20:42.280 --> 00:20:43.780
All ready.

00:20:46.660 --> 00:20:47.580
Here I go.

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:20.400
Ritsu-san sacrificed so much.

00:21:34.660 --> 00:21:36.790
I'm sorry, Sis.

00:21:37.210 --> 00:21:38.710
Don't worry.

00:21:38.880 --> 00:21:43.670
Anyways, did you see how strong she was?
I'm so proud!

00:21:43.840 --> 00:21:45.550
We did it.

00:21:45.720 --> 00:21:48.510
Wakaba-kun, is your hand okay?

00:21:48.680 --> 00:21:53.020
Yes, Midori-san hit my arm too,
so it's okay now.

00:21:53.640 --> 00:21:55.730
We can go on now.

00:21:55.890 --> 00:21:58.060
Yes, we can go forward.

00:21:58.230 --> 00:22:01.400
-Let's go!
-Rinacchi's going first!

00:22:01.570 --> 00:22:03.110
Rinayo too!

00:22:05.360 --> 00:22:06.610
Wow.

00:22:07.570 --> 00:22:08.610
You did it.

00:22:13.120 --> 00:22:14.200
What's wrong?

00:22:14.370 --> 00:22:15.700
Just now...

00:22:16.460 --> 00:22:19.120
I mean, it's nothing.
